Models DUET runs (not included in this repository; each keeps its own licence)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Granite Speech TurboCTC (IBM), English speech recognition
  Apache License 2.0.
Silero VAD v5 (snakers4/silero-vad), voice activity
  MIT License. https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
Supertonic-3 (Supertone Inc.), the voice
  OpenRAIL-M. Its use restrictions apply to everyone who uses the voices and
  must be passed on with them, including the ban on impersonating a real person.
  Our own voice styles are designed, not cloned, and are not published.
  https://huggingface.co/Supertone/supertonic-3
bge-small-en-v1.5 (BAAI), the text encoder under the reflex heads
  MIT License. https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
Whisper large-v3-turbo (OpenAI), Spanish and German recognition, run through
  ffmpeg's whisper filter (whisper.cpp)
  MIT License. https://github.com/openai/whisper
Qwen3 4B Instruct 2507 (Alibaba Qwen), the words
  Apache License 2.0.
Gemma 3 12B (Google), the Spanish tutor's words when installed
  Gemma Terms of Use. https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

